+//                                          集合检查,只 order 绿;M21 是"删整 if",
+//                                          subset/ghost/order 三者都绿)
+//   M22 persist 钉死 "local"          → 预测 {t-persist}
+//   M23 expectedCells raw 长度/去重   → 预测 {t-expectedcells-dup}
+//   M24 kernelModes 与期望 kernel 绑定 → 预测 {t-kernel}
+//   M25 manifest shape guard(schema)  → 预测 {t-shape-expectedcells, t-shape-kernelmodes,
+//                                          t-shape-manifest, t-cli-shape}
+//   M26 输出回显白名单化(sanitizeToken + headShaToken 原样透传) → 预测 {t-ctl-runid,
+//                                          t-ctl-headsha, t-ctl-name}
